  "subtitle": "",
  "subtitle_en": "",
  "lead": "她乘著莢舟抵岸。一片葉可以盛水，一支木匙可以指路；石頭卻不肯照她的意思移動。她和夥伴種下幾行綠意，也留下未完的空土。離開之前，她還想看看粟穗上面的天空。",
  "lead_en": "She arrives in a seedpod boat. A leaf holds water; a wooden spoon suggests a path. The stone refuses to move. Together they plant a few green rows, leaving bare earth between them. Before she goes, she wants to see the sky above the millet.",
  "statement_title": "",
  "statement": "她乘著莢舟抵岸。一片葉可以盛水，一支木匙可以指路；石頭卻不肯照她的意思移動。她和夥伴種下幾行綠意，也留下未完的空土。離開之前，她還想看看粟穗上面的天空。\n\n田還沒有種滿，\n水還沒有停下。\n她帶走一枚種子，\n把下一季留給岸上的人。",
  "statement_en": "She arrives in a seedpod boat. A leaf holds water; a wooden spoon suggests a path. The stone refuses to move. Together they plant a few green rows, leaving bare earth between them. Before she goes, she wants to see the sky above the millet.\n\nThe field is unfinished.\nThe water keeps moving.\nShe carries a seed away,\nleaving another season on the shore.",
  "afterword": "田還沒有種滿，\n水還沒有停下。\n她帶走一枚種子，\n把下一季留給岸上的人。",
  "afterword_en": "The field is unfinished.\nThe water keeps moving.\nShe carries a seed away,\nleaving another season on the shore.",
  "series_statement": "《神話未完成》\n史旺姬走進流傳至今的神話，留下它最核心的問題，讓它面對今天的生活。神話一直被講述、被使用，所以還沒有完成。",
  "series_statement_en": "Myths in the Making\nSwanky Ji steps into myths that are still being told, keeps the question at their heart, and lets it meet the life we live now. A myth that is still told and still used is not yet finished.",
